  <Placemark>
    <name>Leysin: Endless Ride (enduro descent)</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The long natural enduro line off the Berneuse towards Prafandaz and Roc de Veyges - the reason most people come to Leysin rather than for the bike park itself.]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-gray</styleUrl>
