  <Placemark>
    <name>Crans-Montana - Cry d'Er [35 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Cry d'Er 2263 m - top of the Crans gondola</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Three downhill runs covering every level plus a new flowtrail. Flowtrail Arnouva is the beginner line - wide, rolling, a good place to learn to let go of the brakes. Cry d'Er Downhill is the intermediate/technical one: berms, rock features and a proper rhythm section. Beyond the park, Freeride Grand Montana and the Montana-Village > Loc flowtrail give you long natural descents through the larch forest all the way to the valley.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer day pass around 35 CHF; Crans - Cry d'Er return alone is 25 CHF. Bike park runs 13 June - 25 October 2026.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 13 June; closed from 26 October (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + funicular</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.crans-montana.ch/en/bike/">Crans-Montana bike</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
