    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Anzère - Pas de Maimbré [bikes ride free]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Pas-de-Maimbré 2362 m - top of the Anzère gondola</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>One marked downhill line plus four signed routes totalling around 80 km. The DH starts from the Pas de Maimbre or from the mid station, picks up just below La Dent and finishes at the bottom of the Masques trail - about 380 m of continuous descent on the steep part. High, open and dry: a good choice in a wet spell lower down.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Carrying a mountain bike on the gondola is free in summer, which makes this unusually good value; you only pay your own passenger ticket. Anzere is a Magic Pass resort.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 June; closed from 19 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~1h50</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.anzere.ch/en/P77519/mountain-bike">Anzere tourism</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-green</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>7.385609,46.314928,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app">
