  <Placemark>
    <name>Verbier - 4 Vallées [47 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Les Ruinettes 2200 m - bike park top</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Verbier Bike Park by Commencal: the most serious lift-served downhill within two hours of Lausanne. Long, steep, properly rough World-Cup-adjacent lines off Les Ruinettes and La Chaux, plus a huge natural enduro network reaching down 1500 m to Le Chable. Savoleyres is the quieter side with more natural, flowy trails. Bring a real bike and pads.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Verbier bike day pass 47 CHF; the full 4 Vallees bike day pass 57 CHF. Season: Verbier 229 CHF, 4 Vallees 329 CHF. Le Chable > Verbier return is 12.80 CHF and Verbier > Les Ruinettes return 25 CHF if you only want one lap. 10% off online 10+ days ahead. Main summer season 4 July - 21 September 2026.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 4 July; closed from 22 September (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train</td><td>~1h50</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://verbier4vallees.ch/en/activities/bike">Verbier 4 Vallees</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>7.252660,46.091099,0</coordinates></Point>
