  <Placemark>
    <name>Leukerbad - Torrent [~40 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Rinderhütte 2350 m - top of the Torrent cable car</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>A well-signed Valais trail network rather than a bike park. Torrenttrail Bike (114) is the long one off the Rinderhutte; Chällerflue Bike (116) and the Deleeschi and Jales Flow flowtrails give you a mix of natural and built riding. High, sunny and dry, with thermal baths at the bottom - the best recovery of any spot on this list.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Torrent-Bahnen day tickets - price not verified here, budget 35-45 CHF; check torrent.ch before travelling.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 June; closed from 19 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~2h05</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.leukerbad.ch/en/experiences/summer/biking">Leukerbad</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-green</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>7.648433,46.368666,0</coordinates></Point>
