  <Placemark>
    <name>Jeizinen / Gampel (Valais) [small cable car]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Jeizinen 1526 m - top of the Gampel cable car</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Two marked local routes that see almost no traffic: Jeizibarg Bike (117) and Jeizi Enduro (118), dropping through the dry south-facing slopes above the Rhone. Steep, loose, natural. The Pfyn-Finges nature park right below is worth a detour on the way back.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Small local cable car (Luftseilbahn Gampel-Jeizinen), runs all year, cheap by Valais standards - price not verified here.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 May; closed from 1 November (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train</td><td>~1h55</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.gampel-bratsch-tourismus.ch/en/">Gampel-Bratsch tourism</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-green</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>7.722936,46.326332,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app">
      <Data name="spot"><value>jeizinen</value></Data>
      <Data name="tags"><value>expert natural</value></Data>
      <Data name="open_from"><value>05-01</value></Data>
      <Data name="closed_from"><value>11-01</value></Data>
      <mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon>
      <mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
