  <Placemark>
    <name>Bernex (Haute-Savoie, FR) [Magic Pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bernex bike trails - Pré-Richard sector</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>A compact set of built trails above the village: La Verte (easiest), Bern'land, Chill Trail, Wood Roots, River Creek and Hors Piste. Mostly forest, mostly flowy, and a genuinely short trip if you take the boat.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Bernex joins the Magic Pass network for the 2026/27 season. Summer lift operation is not guaranteed every day - verify before travelling, otherwise it is a pedal-up spot.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 July; closed from 1 September (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Boat + bus</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.bernex.fr/en/">Bernex tourism</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-green</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>6.695000,46.349500,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app">
      <Data name="spot"><value>bernex</value></Data>
      <Data name="tags"><value>beginner magicpass natural</value></Data>
      <Data name="open_from"><value>07-01</value></Data>
      <Data name="closed_from"><value>09-01</value></Data>
      <mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon>
      <mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
