  <Placemark>
    <name>Les Deux Alpes (Isere, FR) [33 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Jandri / Vallee Blanche sector - lift hub</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>98 km of marked trails and one of the biggest lift-served verticals in Europe - over 2000 m from the glacier down to Venosc. Everything from wide green flow to raw World Cup black, plus the Vallee Blanche run. Far too far for a day trip: ~4h30 by train to Grenoble via Geneva and Lyon, then the Transaltitude bus. Treat it as a long weekend, or an easy hour if you are already in Grenoble.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Bike park day pass 33 EUR adult, 4 hours 26 EUR, 2 days 57 EUR. Season 320 EUR, or 345 EUR for the three-area pass shared with Alpe d'Huez and La Grave. Trails open 11 April - 30 August 2026, daily from 13 June, with Thursday night riding until 22:30 between 9 July and 27 August.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 11 April; closed from 31 August (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Grenoble</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h10</td></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~6h</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.les2alpes.com/summer/mountain-bike-bike-park/">Les 2 Alpes</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>6.126549,45.009907,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app">
      <Data name="spot"><value>deuxalpes</value></Data>
      <Data name="tags"><value>beginner expert bikepark</value></Data>
      <Data name="open_from"><value>04-11</value></Data>
      <Data name="closed_from"><value>08-31</value></Data>
      <Data name="price_day"><value>33 EUR</value></Data>
      <Data name="price_season"><value>320 EUR</value></Data>
      <mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon>
      <mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
