  <Placemark>
    <name>Lenzerheide - Bike Kingdom Park [from 53 CHF]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Parpaner Rothorn 2861 m - top of the Rothorn gondola</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Switzerland's most serious bike destination, and a UCI World Cup venue - the 2026 round is 19-21 June. The Bike Kingdom Park runs five parallel lines off the same lift so you can pick your level and lap all day: FLOWline (green, wide and rolling), PRIMEline and SHOREline in the middle, STYLEline for jumps, and STRAIGHTline, the steep, fast World Cup track. Beyond the park, the Biketicket to RIDE network and the Bike Attack race line drop the full 1400 m off the Rothorn. Big Skill Centre at the Rothorn valley station for a warm-up.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Bike Kingdom day ticket from 53 CHF, about 6% less booked online. One ticket covers Lenzerheide, Arosa and Chur, and bike carriage is included on every lift. Multi-day tickets and the Gravity Card season pass are the sensible options if you stay.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 June; closed from 26 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~4h30</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.bikekingdom.ch/en">Bike Kingdom</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>9.597404,46.742630,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app">
      <Data name="spot"><value>lenzerheide</value></Data>
