  <Placemark>
    <name>Les 7 Laux - Prapoutel (Belledonne) [21.50 EUR online]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Chamois - top of the chairlift</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>The other side of the Belledonne from Chamrousse, and the rowdier of the two. A dense set of numbered descents - Or'Anjina, Bel'Dina, Jasse and Cortillets for flow, Bloody Roots and Bloody Rock for the rough stuff, Mini Shore and Chevre Shore for woodwork. Steep, rooty and often damp under the trees, with a long run-out all the way to Froges in the valley if you want the full 1100 m.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Day pass 21.50 EUR online, 23.50 EUR at the window; 4 hours 18 EUR, two days 37.50 EUR, six days 67 EUR. Lifts run 4 July to 30 August 2026, and the Bouquetins and Chamois chairlifts alternate rather than both running every day.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 4 July; closed from 31 August (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Grenoble</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.les7laux.com/en/summer/bike-park/">Les 7 Laux</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>6.018802,45.247142,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app">
      <Data name="spot"><value>sept-laux</value></Data>
      <Data name="tags"><value>beginner expert bikepark</value></Data>
      <Data name="open_from"><value>07-04</value></Data>
      <Data name="closed_from"><value>08-31</value></Data>
      <Data name="price_day"><value>21.50 EUR</value></Data>
      <mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon>
      <mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
