  <Placemark>
    <name>La Berra (Fribourg Prealps) [37 CHF / Magic Pass]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>La Berra 1719 m - top of the gondola</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Berra Bike Park: two purpose-built descents totalling about 9 km. Les Allieres is the blue one, 5.6 km of berms, smooth sections and small jumps looking out over the Prealps - one of the best beginner-to-intermediate flow runs in French-speaking Switzerland. La Tschaka is the red: technical features, steeper banks and real jumps. Small, well kept, and rarely busy midweek.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Bike day pass 37 CHF, single ascent 17 CHF, pedestrian return 23 CHF. Free with the Magic Pass. Season 1 July to 31 October, daily from 09:00, with late evening running from mid-July to mid-September.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 July; closed from 1 November (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Published opening time; closing time is estimated.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~1h50</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.laberra.ch/en/bike-park/">La Berra</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>7.178790,46.677656,0</coordinates></Point>
