  <Placemark>
    <name>Bellwald (Goms, above Fiesch) [gondola, price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Richinen 2000 m - top of the Bellwald gondola</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>The surprise of the upper Valais: a small village with five properly built trails off one lift, and almost nobody on them. Flowtrail Forest Bump and Sliderman are the flowing ones, Into the Wild and Vast & Furious get rougher, and Downhill Dirty Cranking is what the name suggests. South facing, so it dries fast and rides well into October.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Small local gondola to Richinen. Bike carriage is offered; check bellwald.ch for fare before travelling.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 June; closed from 19 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Train + bus</td><td>~2h45</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.bellwald.ch/en/bike">Bellwald</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>8.166794,46.441362,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app">
      <Data name="spot"><value>bellwald</value></Data>
      <Data name="tags"><value>beginner expert bikepark</value></Data>
      <Data name="open_from"><value>06-15</value></Data>
      <Data name="closed_from"><value>10-19</value></Data>
      <mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon>
      <mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
