  <Placemark>
    <name>La Colmiane (Valdeblore, Mercantour) [15 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Pic de la Colmiane 1785 m - top of the Pic chairlift</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>The small, friendly one, and the closest lift-served riding to Nice. Two graded descents, one green and one blue, run under the chairlift, with further natural lines off the top for anyone happy to link them by map. Around 300 m of descent per lap through open larch forest. A good first bike park rather than a destination.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Pic chairlift from Col Saint-Martin carries bikes; the ride is included in the pass. Day pass 15 EUR for riders over 12. Open 6 June to 1 November 2026, weekends plus every day of the summer holidays.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 6 June; closed from 2 November (published 2026 dates).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Nice</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h20</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.lacolmiane.com/en/summer/mountain-bike/">La Colmiane</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
