  <Placemark>
    <name>Ravin du Rank: Col de la Madone > Gorbio</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The complete 2.743 km Ravin du Rank descent from the Col de la Madone toward Gorbio: 554 m down, graded T5 / E2 by <a href="https://vttour.fr/sentiers/83">VTTour</a>. Hyper-rough, narrow and ridden downhill only; climbing it means carrying the bike throughout.]]></description>
