    <name>Menton: Sainte-Agnes GR51 trailhead</name>
    <description><![CDATA[Start of the mapped Sainte-Agnes > Monti descent: the complete GR51 trail described by <a href="https://vttour.fr/sentiers/137">VTTour sentier 137</a> (T3 / E2).]]></description>
