  <Placemark>
    <name>Menton: Sainte-Agnes > Monti</name>
    <description><![CDATA[The complete 4.5 km Sainte-Agnes > Monti GR51 trail referenced by <a href="https://vttour.fr/sentiers/137">VTTour sentier 137</a>: about 500 m down and 80 m up, graded T3 / E2. The line stops at Monti before the road descent into Menton. Geometry reconstructed from OpenStreetMap via BRouter and intended as a planning aid, not turn-by-turn navigation.]]></description>
