  <Placemark>
    <name>MTB Zone Bikepark Petzen (Carinthia) [49.50 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Petzen 1700 m - top of the Petzen gondola</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Home of the Flow Country Trail: 11.5 km of continuous, brakeless flow from 1700 m down to the valley, named best flow trail in the world by the IMBA in 2014 and still one of the longest in Europe. It is the reason most people drive to Carinthia. Around it sit the Shakedown, Freeride, Thriller, Jump Trail and an EWS race line, so the same 1050 m of vertical also gives you something rough to ride.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Petzen gondola climbs from 650 m in Feistritz to 1700 m, daily 9:00 to 16:30 with the last ride up at 16:15. Day pass 49.50 EUR adult, 44.50 EUR for four hours, season 430 EUR across the MTB Zone parks.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 May; closed from 27 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:30<br/><small>Published hours; last ascent at 16:15.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Klagenfurt</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Ljubljana</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.mtbzone-bikepark.com/en/bikeparks/petzen/">MTB Zone Petzen</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
