  <Placemark>
    <name>Scuol - Motta Naluns (Unterengadin) [lift pass, price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Motta Naluns 2145 m - top of the Scuol gondola</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>The quiet one. Ten marked mountain-bike routes fan out from Motta Naluns, two easy, two intermediate, three advanced and three hard, and they are natural trails cut into the hillside rather than shaped berms. 850 m of descent back to Scuol, and the Unterengadin gets a lot more sun and a lot fewer riders than Graubunden's headline parks. Finish in the Scuol thermal baths.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Scuol gondola carries bikes, as do the Ftan and Naluns chairlifts. The operator publishes its summer tariff on bergbahnen-scuol.ch; we could not confirm a 2026 bike day rate, so check before you go.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 June; closed from 19 October (typical window; check the operator and conditions).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Zurich</td><td>Train</td><td>~3h00</td></tr><tr><td>Landeck</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.engadin.com/en/bike">Engadin Scuol</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
