  <Placemark>
    <name>Les Gets - Chavannes (Portes du Soleil, FR) [38 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Chavannes 1490 m - top of the Chavannes gondola</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>128 km of marked trail on its own, and the gateway to the 650 km Portes du Soleil network next door. The Chavannes side holds most of the bike park - flow lines, jump trails and a well-judged green progression - while Mont Chery across the valley has the steep, rooty World Championship downhill track. As complete a bike-park week as France offers.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Chavannes gondola and Chavannes Express from the village at 1170 m, plus the Mont Chery gondola. A Portes du Soleil day pass is 38 EUR online, 40 EUR at the desk; season 438 EUR. A single Les Gets lift ride is 9.30 EUR.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 19 June; closed from 13 September (published 2026 dates). Mont Chery closes 30 August; pre-opening weekends from 22 May.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Geneva</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Lausanne</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.lesgets.com/en/to-do/summer/mountain-bike/">Les Gets</a>. Prices, schedules, trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
