  <Placemark>
    <name>Oukaimeden High Atlas Enduro (MA) [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Oukaimeden plateau, about 2600 m - High Atlas natural enduro</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>A high-altitude base for raw, unmarked descents on mule trails, goat paths and old village tracks rather than a maintained bike park. Guided rides link jeep tracks with technical scree traverses, rock, compacted earth, switchbacks and long singletrack descents through Berber villages and pine forest. A documented one-way Oukaimeden to Asni route is about 33 km with roughly 1785 m of descent and 245 m of climbing; the nearby Asni network has about 37 km of mapped trail. Best for experienced, self-sufficient enduro riders.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No dependable bike lift. Pedal, arrange a vehicle shuttle, or ride with a local guide from Marrakech. The winter ski lifts are not a bike-park uplift. Carry repair supplies, water and offline navigation; trails are unsigned and route conditions can change after storms or road works.<br/><br/><p class="warn">&#9888;&#65039; Remote natural mountain terrain with exposure, livestock and pedestrians. Do not ride blindly through villages or cultivated land, and use a local guide for the larger point-to-point descents.</p><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 April; closed from 1 December (typical riding window). Snow can linger at altitude in winter, while midsummer is very hot lower in the valleys; spring and autumn are usually best.<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Marrakech</td><td>Car / shuttle</td><td>~1h45</td></tr><tr><td>Asni</td><td>Car / shuttle</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/><i>Sources: <a href="https://bike-morocco.com/marrakech-biking-day-trip/morocco-singletrack/atlas-mountains-single-tracks">Bike Morocco High Atlas singletrack</a>, <a href="https://www.trailforks.com/region/asni-72491/">Trailforks Asni region</a> and <a href="https://www.wikiloc.com/offroading-trails/oukaimeden-asni-90217787">Oukaimeden-Asni route report</a>. Seasonal dates are an average, not an official opening calendar; check weather and local conditions.</i>]]></description>
