  <Placemark>
    <name>Kopaonik Bike Park (RS) [lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Pancicev Vrh, Kopaonik - Serbia's lift-served DH park</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>A small proper downhill park in Serbia's main mountain resort. Three named descents - KGB, Struga and Mordor - total about 5 km across different surfaces, from approachable sections to steeper technical terrain. A skills area in Dolina Sportova adds practice features, while the wider mountain hosts longer MTB routes and the annual Tri Strane Kopaonika event.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The four-seat Pancicev Vrh chairlift has bike carriers and serves the downhill trail starts. Bike rental is available near the lift base. Summer lift dates, daily bike acceptance and prices can vary, so confirm them with the resort before travelling specifically for the park.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 15 June; closed from 15 September (typical summer-lift window; exact 2026 bike-park dates not published in the sources checked).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Belgrade</td><td>Car</td><td>~3h45</td></tr><tr><td>Nis</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/><i>Sources: <a href="https://www.kopaonik.rs/letnji-sadrzaji-kopaonika/">Kopaonik summer activities</a> and <a href="https://www.tristranekopaonika.rs/">2026 Kopaonik MTB event</a>. Seasonal dates are an average; verify lift operation.</i>]]></description>
