  <Placemark>
    <name>La Molina Bike Park (Catalonia, ES) [31 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>La Tosa and Cap de Comella above La Molina - Spain's largest lift park</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Thirteen downhill circuits and more than 45 km of riding split between La Tosa and Comella, with freeride features, a woodpark, e-bike routes and a children's zone. The range runs from progression tracks to the 2.3 km Comella DH race course, which loses more than 400 m through technical natural and shaped sections.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Cadi-Moixero gondola and Cap de Comella chairlift serve the park. The latest verified adult day rate is 31 EUR including insurance; check the resort for the current 2026 rate and lift schedule.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 14 June; closed from 6 October (typical window based on the latest full published season). Core daily lift operation is concentrated in July and August, with reduced schedules outside it.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Barcelona</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr><tr><td>Barcelona</td><td>Train</td><td>~3h00</td></tr></table><br/><i>Sources: <a href="https://www.lamolina.cat/en/summer/resort/facilities-opening-status/">official La Molina opening report</a> and resort prices; seasonal dates are an estimate.</i>]]></description>
