  <Placemark>
    <name>Trail Park Klinovec (CZ) [lift price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Klinovec 1244 m - long lift-served flow trails on the Czech-German border</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>One of Czechia's headline bike parks, known for unusually long descents: the easy Azur flow trail is about 10 km, Rubin about 8 km and Baron about 6 km. Shorter technical enduro and downhill lines add roots, rocks and steeper sections, giving useful progression from first park laps to expert riding.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Prima Express chairlift carries bikes from the Jachymov side. Current bike-pass prices vary by date and were not reliably exposed by the operator, so check the official ticket shop before travelling.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 May; closed from 1 November (typical lift-served window; check the current calendar).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Prague</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h00</td></tr><tr><td>Dresden</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.trailpark.cz/">official Trail Park Klinovec site</a>; verify lift and trail status.</i>]]></description>
