  <Placemark>
    <name>Rychlebske Stezky (CZ) [no lift, donation supported]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Cerna Voda trail centre - hand-built riding in the Rychleby Mountains</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>A celebrated community trail network built around granite slabs, boulders, roots and old forest paths. Lower flow and skills trails offer progression, while the classic SuperFlow and rocky upper routes reward strong technical riders. Trails start and finish near the main base.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br>No lift: all routes are pedal-accessed. Riding is donation-supported; contribute at the base to fund maintenance and use local services where possible.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 April; closed from 1 November (typical riding window). Do not ride during freeze-thaw, snow or official wet-weather closures.<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Olomouc</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Wroclaw</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h15</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.rychlebskestezky.cz/cs/traily">official Rychlebske Stezky trail page</a>; check current closures.</i>]]></description>
