  <Placemark>
    <name>Ballyhoura MTB Trails (IE) [no lift, parking fee]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Ballyhoura trailhead - Ireland's largest waymarked MTB network</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Five purpose-built forest loops range from the 7 km Greenwood blue route to the 51 km Castlepook red. Expect long forest-road climbs linked by tight singletrack, fast descents and increasingly rocky, technical sections. The network suits beginners on the shortest loop and experienced riders on the full red circuits.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift: every route is a pedal-powered loop. Trail access is free, with cashless parking charged at the trailhead; rental, bike wash and showers are available.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round, with the car park operating 08:00-22:00. Storm damage, harvesting and saturated ground can close individual sections.<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Limerick</td><td>Car</td><td>~50 min</td></tr><tr><td>Cork</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h10</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.coillte.ie/site/ballyhoura/">official Coillte Ballyhoura page</a>; obey live closure signs.</i>]]></description>
