  <Placemark>
    <name>Bike Park Kasina (PL) [169 PLN]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Snieznica above Kasina Wielka - compact lift-served gravity park</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>A well-established Polish park with flow, jump and downhill lines packed into a compact hill. Easier shaped trails support progression, while rooty forest tracks and steeper technical variants suit advanced riders.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>A high-speed chairlift carries bikes. The published 2026 regular adult day ticket is 169 PLN, or 149 PLN with the phone-sticker pass.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 May; closed from 1 November (typical operating window; check weekday and shoulder-season schedules).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Krakow</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h10</td></tr><tr><td>Zakopane</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h20</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://kasinaski.pl/en/price-lists/bike-park-price-list/">official Kasina 2026 price list</a>; check opening hours.</i>]]></description>
