  <Placemark>
    <name>Gora Zar Bike Park (PL) [funicular price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Gora Zar 761 m - steep gravity trails above Miedzybrodzie Zywieckie</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>A smaller Polish gravity venue with fast shaped sections and technical forest riding on a steep hill. It is best suited to intermediate and expert riders rather than first-time mountain bikers.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The PKL funicular carries riders toward the trail starts when bike service is operating. Current bike-specific pricing was not reliably published; confirm carriage and trail status before travelling.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 May; closed from 1 October (typical 2026 bike season, subject to announcements and weather).<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Katowice</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Krakow</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h45</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.pkl.pl/post/gora-zar/aktualnosci/otwarcie-tras-rowerowych-na-gorze-zar-juz-niebawem.html">PKL 2026 bike-trail announcement</a>; verify bike uplift.</i>]]></description>
