  <Placemark>
    <name>Munaka Bike and Hike Park (Estonia) [chairlift price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Vaike Munamagi above Otepaa - Estonia's chairlift-served bike park</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>A small purpose-built enduro park using Estonia's unusually hilly Otepaa terrain. Short descents mix shaped features and natural forest surfaces, with bike rental and e-bike routes extending the riding beyond the lift hill.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Estonia's only summer chairlift carries bikes. Current day pricing was not reliably exposed, so check the operator before visiting.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 19 June; closed from 22 September (published main season). Weekend operation is standard; riding before and after the main dates is available to prebooked groups through 1 November.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Tartu</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr><tr><td>Tallinn</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/><i>Sources: <a href="https://www.munakas.ee/en/home/">official Munakas site</a> and Visit Estonia; check weekend hours.</i>]]></description>
