  <Placemark>
    <name>Riekstukalns DH Trails (Latvia) [no public uplift verified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Riekstukalns near Baldone - Latvia's most established downhill training hill</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Short, steep community-maintained downhill lines use the ski hill's compact vertical, with roots, jumps and race-oriented features. This is a local training venue rather than a full-service destination park.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No dependable public bike uplift was verified: expect push-up or pedal access unless an event announces otherwise. Confirm access with the local downhill community.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 May; closed from 1 November (typical regional riding window; event and land-use restrictions can apply).<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Riga</td><td>Car</td><td>~40 min</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://downhill.lv/contact/">Downhill.lv training locations</a>; verify permission and conditions locally.</i>]]></description>
