  <Placemark>
    <name>Sigulda DH Trails (Latvia) [no public uplift verified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Gauja valley slopes at Sigulda - Latvian downhill and enduro terrain</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Short, steep natural descents around the deeply cut Gauja valley support local downhill training and racing. Expect roots, loam and compact technical runs rather than a signed commercial bike-park network.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No dependable public bike uplift was verified. Use pedal or push-up access and confirm the current legal training location with local riders before setting out.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 1 May; closed from 1 November (typical regional riding window). Weather, events and protected-area rules may restrict individual trails.<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Riga</td><td>Car / train</td><td>~1h00</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://downhill.lv/contact/">Downhill.lv training locations</a>; verify exact permitted trails locally.</i>]]></description>
