  <Placemark>
    <name>Semnoz Bike Park (Annecy, FR) [17.50 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Semnoz above Lake Annecy - compact new Télémix-served park</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Four dedicated descents provide unusually clear progression close to Annecy: one family green, one more technical blue and two red trails with shaped turns, jumps and modules. It is a compact park rather than a full holiday domain, but its accessibility makes it a valuable local gravity spot.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Télémix carries bikes to the trail starts. The published 2026 adult day pass is 17.50 EUR, or 14.50 EUR for four consecutive hours.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 20 June; closed from 21 September (published 2026 dates). Daily operation runs from 4 July through 30 August; June and September have selected weekend dates.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Annecy</td><td>Car / summer bus</td><td>~35 min</td></tr><tr><td>Geneva</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.semnoz.fr/vtt/">official Semnoz Bike Park page</a>; check operating dates.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>6.097538,45.803367,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app">
      <Data name="spot"><value>semnoz</value></Data>
      <Data name="tags"><value>beginner expert bikepark</value></Data>
