  <Placemark>
    <name>Le Grand-Bornand MTB (Aravis, FR) [20 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Rosay and Lachat above Le Grand-Bornand - lift-assisted Aravis trail riding</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>More than 178 km across sixteen marked routes combine high alpine tracks, natural singletrack, cross-country loops and long descents into the village. The riding is less shaped than a dedicated DH park; the Grand Tour and Enduro du Grand-Bo are the notable sportier options.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Rosay gondola and Lachat chairlift provide bike access to the upper network. The published 2026 adult day pass covering both lifts is 20 EUR.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 27 June; closed from 7 September (published 2026 span, including preview and closing weekends). Core daily operation runs from 4 July through 29 August.<br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Annecy</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Geneva</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h10</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.legrandbornand.com/app/uploads/legrandbornand/2026/04/Summer-activities-guide-2026.pdf">official 2026 summer guide</a>; check which lift serves your route.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-green</styleUrl>
