  <Placemark>
    <name>Manigod - Tete de Cabeau (Aravis, FR) [18 EUR]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Tete de Cabeau 1650 m - small family-oriented lift park at Croix Fry</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Five family descents and one advanced trail make this a compact progression park. The green Aiglon line is about 1.1 km with 84 m of descent; harder variants add more speed, natural surface and technical features without the scale of nearby La Clusaz.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The Tete de Cabeau chairlift carries mountain bikes. The published 2026 adult day pass is 18 EUR, with single rides available for 8 EUR.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from 27 June; closed from 31 August (published 2026 dates), operating 10:00-17:00 subject to conditions.<br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-17:00<br/><small>Published operating hours; check the operator schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Annecy</td><td>Car</td><td>~45 min</td></tr><tr><td>Geneva</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://en.manigod.com/chairlift-for-pedestrians-mountain-bikers-and-mountain-carts.html">official Manigod 2026 lift page</a>; check trail status.</i>]]></description>
