  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Zoom Bike Park (Campos do Jordao, BR) [price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Campos do Jordao - maintained Mantiqueira trail centre</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>A purpose-built, signed network for XC, all-mountain and enduro, with progression-friendly singletrack, technical lines and e-MTB-suitable climbing. The park is built and maintained specifically for mountain bikes rather than being an informal forest network.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift was verified: climb under your own power. Current admission, booking and wet-weather status must be checked with the operator.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Normally rideable year-round, with rain closures possible. <br/>Daily opening hours: 08:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical daily estimate; check the operator schedule and rain closures.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Sao Paulo</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h45</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://zoombikepark.com.br/">official Zoom Bike Park</a>.</i>]]></description>
