      <mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Serra da Canastra Adventure MTB (Minas Gerais, BR) [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Sao Roque de Minas gateway - high-plateau adventure riding</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Long red-dirt roads, rocky tracks, granite slabs and rural connectors cross the Canastra plateau and its waterfall country. The best riding is XC and backcountry trail exploration rather than gravity laps; carry navigation, water and repair equipment.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Pedal point-to-point or arrange a 4x4 support vehicle. National-park entry rules and permitted cycling routes must be checked before departure.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Best from May to September in the dry season; summer storms can make river crossings and clay roads unsafe.<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Belo Horizonte</td><td>Car</td><td>~5h30</td></tr></table><br/><i>Sources: <a href="https://www.gov.br/turismo/pt-br/assuntos/ultimas-noticia/o-encanto-das-aguas-e-queijos-da-serra-da-canastra">Brazil Ministry of Tourism</a> and <a href="https://turismodelfinopolis.com.br/">Delfinopolis tourism</a>. Verify protected-area rules.</i>]]></description>
