    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Twin Lakes MTB Trail (Tagaytay, PH) [access status unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Twin Lakes estate above Taal - compact scenic trail</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>A 2.5 km off-road loop was built with fast descents, berms, off-camber turns, switchbacks, short climbs and views toward Taal Lake. It was designed for mixed abilities, but current maintenance and public access could not be confirmed from a recent operator page.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift; pedal the loop. Confirm at the estate before travelling specifically to ride.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Potentially year-round when open and dry; avoid typhoon and saturated conditions.<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Metro Manila</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.bworldonline.com/travel-tourism/2016/05/13/4980/a-mountain-bike-trail-in-tagaytay/">BusinessWorld trail report</a>. Current status is unverified.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
