  <Placemark>
    <name>Cikole Gravity Trails (Lembang, ID) [shuttle, price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Cikole pine forest above Bandung - established gravity zone</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Deep volcanic soil, pine-forest loam, roots and race-built downhill lines make Cikole one of Indonesia's best-known gravity areas. Expect a mix of raw DH, freeride features and locally shaped flow rather than a single unified resort trail map.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Local vehicle uplift and riding packages are available around the Cikole recreation area; there is no verified fixed public lift pass. Arrange uplift and guide details before arrival.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round, best in the drier May-October period. <br/>Daily opening hours: 08:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical area estimate; confirm with the selected uplift or trail operator.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bandung</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/><i>Sources: Cikole's established MTB riding area and <a href="https://www.indonesia.travel/gb/en/travel-ideas/adventure/10-reason-s-why-you-experience-the-cikole-orchid-forest-at-lembang">Indonesia Travel</a> for the Cikole setting. Confirm the active trail operator.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
