  <Placemark>
    <name>Kintamani / Mount Batur MTB (Bali, ID) [guided shuttle]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Kintamani crater rim - volcanic adventure descents</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Routes start around 1,500 m above the Batur caldera and descend on volcanic sand, dirt tracks, village lanes and tropical singletrack. Guided options range from easy scenic downhill tours to much rougher enduro-style lines toward Tianyar or the lower villages.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Commercial tours provide vehicle transfer to Kintamani; no bike lift. Choose an MTB-specific operator because many advertised cycling tours use easy roads rather than technical trails.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Best from April-October; wet-season storms make volcanic surfaces and jungle sections unpredictable.<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ubud</td><td>Tour shuttle</td><td>~1h15</td></tr></table><br/><i>Sources: <a href="https://visitbali.id/property/recommended-mountain-biking-routes-with-panorama-of-bali-s-natural-beauty">Visit Bali MTB routes</a> and <a href="https://www.indonesia.travel/id/en/destination/bali-nusa-tenggara/bali/kintamani">Indonesia Travel</a>.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
