    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Dizin / Shemshak Alborz Enduro (IR) [no verified bike lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Gardaneh Dizin and Shemshak - high-Alborz alpine riding</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Loose, rocky ski-area roads, ridge tracks and natural paths can produce descents exceeding 1,000 m of vertical in dry, exposed alpine terrain. This is informal backcountry enduro, not a maintained summer bike park.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer bicycle uplift at Dizin or Shemshak could not be verified. Use a local guide and road shuttle or pedal; do not assume winter lifts carry bikes.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Best from June-October after snowmelt. Afternoon storms, altitude and exposure require conservative planning.<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Tehran</td><td>Car / guide shuttle</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.passzwang.net/en/dizin_cycling.php">Dizin Pass cycling guide</a>. MTB access is informal and must be verified locally.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>51.4170,36.0490,0</coordinates></Point>
