      <Data name="open_from"><value>04-01</value></Data><Data name="closed_from"><value>12-01</value></Data>
      <mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Lar National Park / Damavand MTB (IR) [guided, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lar Valley beneath Mount Damavand - high-altitude expedition MTB</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>A serious point-to-point backcountry ride across alpine plateau, riverbeds, dirt tracks and high passes beneath Iran's 5,610 m volcano. Commercial itineraries rate it highly demanding and normally take several days.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Guided trips use support vehicles and camps; permits and protected-area access must be arranged in advance.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from late May through August in a typical year; snow, river levels and conservation closures control access.<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Tehran</td><td>Guide vehicle</td><td>~2h to western approach</td></tr></table><br/><i>Sources: <a href="https://damavand.camp/tours/mountain-biking/5-day-lar-plain-mtb/">Lar Plain MTB itinerary</a> and <a href="https://www.adventureiran.com/mountain-biking-lar-national-park/">Adventure Iran trip report</a>.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-brown</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>52.0500,35.9000,0</coordinates></Point>
    <ExtendedData xmlns:mwm="https://omaps.app">
      <Data name="spot"><value>lar-damavand</value></Data><Data name="tags"><value>expert natural</value></Data>
      <Data name="open_from"><value>05-20</value></Data><Data name="closed_from"><value>09-01</value></Data>
      <mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Thaiwoo Bike Park (Chongli, CN) [gondola price unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Thaiwoo Ski Town - China's flagship lift-served bike park</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Purpose-built summer MTB terrain with gondola-served flow, jumps, pump-track facilities and technical downhill on the Olympic-region mountains. The operator actively lists mountain biking among its summer sports.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Summer gondola uplift is offered, but a current public bike-pass price was not reliably available in English. Confirm ticketing and trail status directly.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open from June; closed from October (typical Chongli bike season). <br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical summer estimate; check the official daily schedule.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Beijing</td><td>Fast train + taxi</td><td>~2h</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.thaiwoo.com/summer">official Thaiwoo summer activities</a>.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>115.4550,40.9040,0</coordinates></Point>
