  <Placemark>
    <name>Genting Secret Garden MTB (Chongli, CN) [summer status unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Genting Snow Park - Olympic resort summer terrain</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>The resort was planned with a mountain-bike raceway and has high-speed gondola infrastructure across substantial alpine terrain. Public 2026 summer MTB operation and trail maintenance could not be confirmed, so treat this as a check-before-travel pin.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Gondolas exist, but bicycle carriage, summer schedule and price are unverified.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Potential June-September operation. <br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-16:30<br/><small>Typical estimate; summer bike operation is unverified.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Beijing</td><td>Fast train + taxi</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://chinasymposium.com/articles/Special_focus/secret_garden_english.pdf">Genting Secret Garden development overview</a>. Confirm current MTB operation.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
