    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Hafjell Bike Park (Norway) [lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Norway's benchmark lift-served downhill park</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Seventeen green-to-black trails cover roughly 28 km, mixing long machine-built flow, jump lines and World Cup-grade technical downhill over substantial vertical. Roller Coaster alone packs 60 jumps and 36 berms.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Gondola and chairlift uplift with rentals at the base. Current day-pass prices vary by date; buy through the operator.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Typically mid-June to mid-October: weekends at each end and daily in high summer. <br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-16:00<br/><small>Typical published hours; operating days vary across the season.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Lillehammer</td><td>Car / bus</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Oslo</td><td>Car</td><td>~2h30</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.hafjellresort.no/hafjell-bike-park">official Hafjell Bike Park</a>.</i>]]></description>
    <styleUrl>#placemark-blue</styleUrl>
    <Point><coordinates>10.4530,61.2310,0</coordinates></Point>
