      <mwm:icon>Transport</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Are Bike Park (Sweden) [gondola / chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Scandinavia's largest lift-served bike park</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Around 40 downhill trails descend from exposed rock slabs into forest, including the long Easy Rider flow line, technical Hallrajd and the classic rocky 1000-metersleden. Separate trail and XC areas add substantial pedal riding.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>VM8 chairlift and gondola serve the downhill network. Bike pass, rental and guiding are available in Are village.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Published 2026 downhill season: weekends from 5 June, daily 21 June-30 August, then Thursday-Sunday through 27 September. <br/>Daily opening hours: 10:00-16:00<br/><small>Published 2026 standard hours; lift and trail status can vary.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Ostersund</td><td>Train / car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/><i>Sources: <a href="https://aresweden.com/en/lifts-and-lift-pass-are-summer/">Are summer lifts</a> and <a href="https://areguiderna.se/are-bike-park/">Are Bike Park guide</a>.</i>]]></description>
