  <Placemark>
    <name>Epleny Bike Park (Hungary) [chairlift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Hungary's main lift-accessed forest bike park</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Built downhill and enduro lines use the wooded Siarena slope, with berms, jumps and race sections plus easier family and e-bike riding nearby.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>The four-seat chairlift provides summer uplift on scheduled bike-park days. Verify the live calendar and ticket price because it is not a continuous daily operation.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Selected spring-to-autumn dates and events; confirm each visit directly. <br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Event-day estimate; verify the bike-park and chairlift calendar.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Budapest</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr><tr><td>Veszprem</td><td>Car</td><td>~25 min</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://siarena.hu/">official Siarena Vibe Park</a>.</i>]]></description>
