  <Placemark>
    <name>Erciyes Bike Park (Kayseri, Turkey) [uplift status unverified]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>High volcanic downhill terrain on Mount Erciyes</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Erciyes developed Turkey's first dedicated downhill courses and has hosted European downhill racing, with multiple difficulty levels and a children's skills area on open volcanic terrain.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>Resort lifts exist and planning documents describe bike transport, but current 2026 public bicycle uplift, maintained routes and pricing were not verified. Contact Erciyes before travel.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Potential June-October season; high-altitude snow, wind and maintenance apply. <br/>Daily opening hours: 09:00-17:00<br/><small>Typical estimate; current bicycle uplift and trail operation are unverified.</small><br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Kayseri</td><td>Car / bus</td><td>~30 min</td></tr></table><br/><i>Sources: <a href="https://www.kayseri.bel.tr/haberler/erciyeste-bisiklet-ve-aktivite-parki-sezonu-acildi14004">Kayseri municipality bike-park announcement</a> and Erciyes resort information.</i>]]></description>
