  <Placemark>
    <name>Karkloof Country Club MTB (South Africa) [permit, no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Major KwaZulu-Natal plantation singletrack network</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>More than 300 km of riding crosses forestry land, river valleys and waterfall country. Marked loops range from short family rides to 55 km, with advanced optional features inside easier routes.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift. Day visitors must start at Karkloof Country Club, pay before riding, sign the indemnity and display the issued bike board. Private-land vehicle drops are prohibited.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Open year-round subject to forestry, fire and weather closures.<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Howick</td><td>Car</td><td>~20 min</td></tr><tr><td>Durban</td><td>Car</td><td>~1h30</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.karkloofclub.co.za/visitors-members/">official visitor and permit rules</a>.</i>]]></description>
