  <Placemark>
    <name>Virgin Freeride / Red Bull Rampage Zone [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Virgin Freeride / Red Bull Rampage Zone - Virgin, UT</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Raw desert freeride terrain around the historic Red Bull Rampage venues: exposed ridgelines, steep chutes, drops and large hand-built features. Event lines cross fragile terrain and are not a public bike park; respect land status, closures and active event zones.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift; pedal access.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Typical regional riding window; weather, snow, heat, fire restrictions and land-management closures override it.<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Virgin</td><td>Car</td><td>Local</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.redbull.com/us-en/events/red-bull-rampage/">land manager or destination information</a>. Trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
