    <name>Soquel Demonstration State Forest [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Soquel Demonstration State Forest - Santa Cruz, CA</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Redwood-forest climbing and technical descending on official roads and trails, with steep grades, roots and jumps. Respect forest closures and only ride designated legal routes.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift; pedal access.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Typical regional riding window; weather, snow, heat, fire restrictions and land-management closures override it.<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Santa Cruz</td><td>Car</td><td>Local</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.fire.ca.gov/what-we-do/natural-resource-management/demonstration-state-forests/soquel-demonstration-state-forest">land manager or destination information</a>. Trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
