      <mwm:icon>Mountain</mwm:icon><mwm:visibility>1</mwm:visibility>
    </ExtendedData>
  </Placemark>
  <Placemark>
    <name>Lunch Loops [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Lunch Loops - Grand Junction, CO</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>Technical high-desert singletrack close to town, known for rock ledges, drops, steep lines and demanding classics such as Free Lunch and The Ribbon.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift; pedal access.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Typical regional riding window; weather, snow, heat, fire restrictions and land-management closures override it.<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Grand Junction</td><td>Car</td><td>Local</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.blm.gov/visit/lunch-loops-trail-system">land manager or destination information</a>. Trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
