  <Placemark>
    <name>Monarch Crest Trail [commercial shuttle]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Monarch Crest Trail - Salida, CO</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>High-altitude backcountry riding above treeline followed by long forest descents. Weather exposure, altitude and remote terrain demand preparation.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>commercial shuttle; book and verify the current operator and price.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Typical regional riding window; weather, snow, heat, fire restrictions and land-management closures override it.<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Salida</td><td>Car</td><td>Local</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.fs.usda.gov/recarea/psicc/recarea/?recid=12613">land manager or destination information</a>. Trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
