  <Placemark>
    <name>Bentonville and Bella Vista Trails [no lift]</name>
    <description><![CDATA[<b>Bentonville and Bella Vista Trails - Bentonville, AR</b><br/><br/><b>Trails</b><br/>A major urban and forest trail destination with extensive purpose-built singletrack, jump lines, technical rock features and all-level progression across multiple connected networks.<br/><br/><b>Getting up / price</b><br/>No lift; pedal access.<br/><br/><b>Open season</b><br/>Typical regional riding window; weather, snow, heat, fire restrictions and land-management closures override it.<br/><br/><b>Access</b><table class="access"><tr><th>From</th><th>Transport</th><th>Duration</th></tr><tr><td>Bentonville</td><td>Car</td><td>Local</td></tr></table><br/><i>Source: <a href="https://www.oztrails.com/">land manager or destination information</a>. Trail status and access can change; verify before travel.</i>]]></description>
